    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;be a function such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to:",
