  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>So, the given limit is in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;form.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Apply <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&#39;Hospital Rule</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p>",
